Abstract: <a class="mention" href="/u/remix7531">@remix7531</a> and I are publishing <a href="https://github.com/remix7531/libshrincs" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">libshrincs</a>, a proof-of-concept C implementation of WOTS+C with machine-checked proofs of functional correctness and security.
WOTS+C is the one-time signature scheme used by <a href="https://delvingbitcoin.org/t/shrincs-324-byte-stateful-post-quantum-signatures-with-static-backups/2158">SHRINCS</a>, a post-quantum signature scheme proposed for Bitcoin.
